        "TileImage": "$($repository d0628b4d-98ac-4fc4-af51-a19eec39bc83).Image",
        "Description": "Mr. Jason Portman&apos;s best friend is fed up with his increesingly erratic behaviour regarding personal life, beauty standards and appearances and wants you to teach him a lesson, 47. \rMr. Portman is staying at Gama hospital for facial reconstruction. Disguise yourself as Mr. Portman, and eliminate his surgeon. Make it look like Mr. Portman was not satisfied with his surgery and let him suffer the consequences. \r\rMr. Jason Portman, please come to the hospital entrance.",
